<title>USA: Asyst sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Asyst sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<text>
<p>FREMONT, Calif., July 22 (Reuter)  Asyst Technologies Inc Tuesday said its board of directors has declared a 2-for-1 stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend to shareholders of record on August 1, 1997.</p>
<p>In a statement, Asyst said its agent will deliver the new stock certificates on or about August 22, 1997.</p>
